T[123003]="Mystic Enchants add significant power to your build. Being fully enchanted will determine your success in end-game content.\n\nApply a Mystic Enchant in all 17 Active Enchant Slots."
T[123004]="Mystic Enchanting Specializations allow you to create different loadouts for your Active Enchants. This allows you to swap your enchants to try out different builds or adapt to specific scenarios."
T[123005]="Worldforged Mystic Enchants cannot be traded or found when Reforging at the Altar. These soulbound Mystic Enchants must be discovered in the world!\n\nAcquire a Worldforged Mystic Enchant Scroll and save it to your collection."
T[123006]="Marks of Triumph are earned by completing Heroic and Mythic difficulty dungeons.\n\nThese marks can be exchanged for gear! Use them to upgrade your gear or save up for specific equipment key to your build.\n\nVisit Markus in the Stormwind Throne Room to see the gear you can acquire."
T[123007]="Marks of Triumph are earned by completing Heroic and Mythic difficulty dungeons.\n\nThese marks can be exchanged for gear! Use them to upgrade your gear or save up for specific equipment key to your build.\n\nTravel to Orgrimmar and speak with Mar'toge in the Valley of Wisdom throne room to see the gear you can acquire."
